/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (IT governance is a set of practices, processes, and structures that ensure the efficient and strategic use of technology within organizations. With the increasing technological dependence, it becomes essential to establish forms of control, strategic alignment, and risk management. This paper presents the main concepts of IT governance, its objectives, benefits, and importance, highlighting that governance directly contributes to value generation, information security, and improvement of organizational efficiency.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
